00:00:01.199 --> 00:00:02.629 align:start position:0%
 
hello everyone  we are at the end of another year  2021  i hope this year have been  [Music]  as meaningful and wonderful as possible  it's been a hard year of course for many  of us as was 2020 and  i'm of course hoping that 2022 will be  easier  in terms of all the things that have  been going on in the world  but here at let's talk religion there's  no denying that it has been probably the  craziest year  ever  i started this channel back in 2018.  well started to do more  regular videos back in the beginning of  2020 so about two years ago but this  year in particular has been incredibly  crazy in terms of the growth of this  channel when we  began the year in january 2021  we were at around  a little more than 50 000 subscribers  and as of me speaking right now we're  pretty close to 300 000 that means that  we have  increased in almost 250 000  in just a year's time which is just  insane to me  i don't understand  why you seem so interested in listening  to what i have to say but i am very  thankful and it makes me hopeful  that the content that i and many other  creators  at the moment are providing you with  something that has been severely lacking  on youtube and on well on the internet  generally which is trustworthy  information  and content about things relating to  religion and  philosophy and or history and these  kinds of things i've really seen in the  last few years  an incredibly  wonderful increase in good material  about this kind of stuff a lot of the  people that i have been  collaborating with and working with  these this last year and and a little  more  are some examples of those kinds of  creators so i think i do some really  great stuff because truly previously and  still  right now i think  in terms of the information on religion  on the internet and on youtube is really  atrocious right it's  either  well it's all really polemical it's  either people criticizing religion  without much knowledge about  religion  from a scholarly perspective and the  same goes for  the other opposite of the spectrum which  is really polemical  channels by practitioners of different  religions who try to  discredit other religions or other  you know sects within their religion etc  it's all about presenting a particular  world view and claiming that that is the  truth or it's about criticizing without  much background knowledge  and a lot of it's just plainly wrong  also there's a lot of  information that comes from dubious  sources that are not academic that are  not scholarly  and so i think what i wanted to do with  this channel was to  increase religious literacy to provide  information provide content that was  trustworthy that was based in academic  research and scholarly  journals and books etc so the quality of  the content on youtube on these topics  could be at least a little better and  the fact that we have  grown so much in the last year gives me  a hope that a lot of you in the audience  are looking for that as well  and that makes me so thankful i can't  express  just how grateful i am that all of you  keep coming that you keep watching my  videos that you keep  engaged in  the comment section some of you are  engaged in  discussions with me on our patreon page  for example it is really wonderful to  see so many people that are engaged and  interested in discussing these these  matters and that i am so so proud to see  that this community  by and large is an incredibly open  community that really discusses and  debates these things from a perspective  that is  so healthy and and just wonderful in so  many ways so i'm really proud of what we  have created here over the last year and  beyond  and i'm really looking forward to seeing  this channel grow in the future as well  um  this video is really just a way of me  or a way for me to say happy new year  to wish you a  meaningful 2022  but also primarily to  say thank you to everyone as i have  done to say thank you to everyone who  keeps watching everyone who comments  everyone who subscribes  and in particular of course a huge thank  you to all of my patrons over on the  patreon page  your monetary support really makes so  much difference and i cannot stress that  enough  really without your support i wouldn't  be able to do what i am doing currently  it's helping me in so many ways  and i'm  so thankful for all of the discussions  and the support in general that i  received from my patrons so to my  patreon community i love you so much  none of this would be possible without  you  and uh i am honored that you have chosen  to support me and my work on this  channel i truly am thank you so so much  i would also like of course to extend a  thank you to all of the wonderful  creators that i have the honor of  working together with over the last year  some of the  most  humble and wonderful people  that i think i've ever met and some of  the most talented people  that i know that are  also doing wonderful work to create a  more  um  a more informed platform and  and and  community here on youtube i'm talking of  course about people like siawish from  almo  like dr justin sledge from the channel  esoterica the channel hikma history  angela puka from angela symposium andrew  henry from religion for breakfast  um  zevi from seekers of unity it's been a  pleasure to work with all of you over  the last year you really  inspire me with your talent and the  content that you make and it's truly an  honor for me to be able to work together  with you um  the success of the channel is also in a  large part thanks to you guys thank you  so much  now that we have  sort of looked back over the last year  it's also a time i think to look forward  to see what is coming in 2022 i will not  be going anywhere at least i don't plan  to uh i will keep making content the way  that i have the last year we have  explored some truly fascinating stuff  we've been exploring music we've talked  about uh sufism we've talked about  things like hermeticism we've gone into  some  christian mysticism as well  we've explored some more of the indian  religious traditions like vedanta and  shankar advaita vedanta  and we even managed to get into some of  the occult sciences back in october  which has all been so so exciting  and for the future i plan on creating  more content just like that  i will begin the year this  weekend  which will be probably on sunday when  i'm recording this will be the first  video of the year which is very exciting  it's a it's a big video about sikhism  it's going to be called what is sikhism  uh i've been looking forward to making  that video for a long time and a lot of  you have been asking for it so that's  finally coming and i'm very excited  about that i want to keep exploring more  of the occult sciences i have a few  really exciting  collaborations planned  for that in particular which i am truly  excited for as well so that's one thing  and then i've also really been wanting  to do some more documentary style  footage  because of the pandemic that's not been  possible for a while obviously  i was planning to go on some trips  this  by like at the end of this year in  december  there were plans to go to jerusalem  there were plans to go to morocco but of  course because of the pandemic and the  fact that it's increased again that had  to be postponed but i'm  hoping that i'll be able to do some  traveling in 2022 and gather some  material and do some more documentary  style videos too to really increase the  production value of this channel in that  way and another announcement is  something that's going to be really fun  and that is that i am actually i'm  finally doing a let's talk religion  podcast so i know a lot of you have been  asking for a podcast and so we're we're  finally doing it uh it's  to begin with it's primarily primarily  just going to be an audio version of  this channel so i'll be converting the  videos that i've made my entire library  or most of it at least into audio form  and releasing that as a as a podcast  but hopefully we will do some exclusive  stuff in audio form there as well  eventually  my wife is actually helping me  do that podcast so she's relieving me of  some of that works that i can focus on  new videos and all the projects that i'm  doing and she she actually works as a  sound engineer so that's that's  wonderful she's really talented and  that's going to be that's going to be  wonderful so you can look forward to the  let's talk religion podcast  coming out  well at the beginning of january  hopefully will be the first episodes on  that uh in in terms of my other creative  projects i will be putting out some more  of the music that i make for this  channel so for those who don't know i  make most of the background music that  you hear in the videos most of that is  made by me  and i did release an ep last year with a  few of the tracks  there will be another actually full  album hopefully coming out pretty soon  with some of that  music that i have made  and i'll be generally also i'll be  trying to do some more music on my other  channel which is just called philly palm  so if you're interested in my musical  endeavors you can go and subscribe to  that and check out that channel  at least i want to  be a little more  active on that channel next year but  that does not mean i will be any less  active on this channel this will be my  main focus of course  although as i have done for the next  last six months or so i will be taking  it a little bit easier than i did last  year 2020 was pretty crazy i did  basically one video a week while also  working a full-time job on the side and  doing a bunch of other projects which at  the end of the day was not very very  good for my mental health so this last  year at least the second half of the  year i've been focusing a lot more on  giving myself some rest from time to  time some weeks i just took  the week off to  rest or to focus on doing research which  allows me to  make better content of course but also  to to recover and  refresh myself so which also leads to  better content hopefully and i'll be  continuing to to do that next year  my goal is to provide you with a couple  of videos a month but sometimes that  might not be possible  we'll see i won't have as strict of a  schedule as i had  like a year ago but there will be plenty  of content i have a long list of videos  that i want to do and  i'm really excited and inspired to keep  working  so anyway uh thank you all again so much  for the support for watching for  commenting for to my patrons thank you  so much um i'm really looking forward to  next year and to  see this community grow even more  again happy new year everyone and i hope  you have a wonderful 2022. i'll see you  in the next video  you

